   "source": [
    "# Data Pipeline for Electromagnetic Field Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "This chapter focuses on building a comprehensive data pipeline using FEMM (Finite Element Method Magnetics) for generating high-quality electromagnetic training data. Unlike simplified analytical approaches, we use industry-standard FEA to ensure accurate physics-based data generation.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Key Features:\n",
    "- **FEMM Integration**: Real finite element analysis using FEMM solver\n",
    "- **Multi-Problem Support**: Coil, Transformer, and IPM Motor problems\n",
    "- **Quality Data**: Physics-based electromagnetic field calculations\n",
    "- **No Fallbacks**: System requires FEMM for authentic results\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Import FEMM solver\n",
    "from femm_solver import CoaxialCoilSolver, FEMM_AVAILABLE\n",
    "\n",
    "# Verify FEMM is available\n",
    "assert FEMM_AVAILABLE, \"FEMM is required for electromagnetic analysis\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## FEMM Solver Classes:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **CoaxialCoilSolver**: For circular coil magnetic field analysis\n",
    "2. **TransformerSolver**: For E-I core transformer analysis  \n",
    "3. **IPMMotorSolver**: For interior permanent magnet motor analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Data Generation Process:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Parameter Sampling**: Latin Hypercube Sampling for parameter space exploration\n",
    "2. **FEMM Analysis**: Real electromagnetic field calculations\n",
    "3. **Field Extraction**: Magnetic flux density, forces, and energy\n",
    "4. **Data Caching**: Efficient result storage and retrieval\n",
    "\n",
    "The system is designed to generate training data for deep learning models that predict magnetic fields with high accuracy using real physics-based simulations."
   ]
  }
 ],
